      "status": "alternative",
      "period": "classical",
      "gloss": "search into, look into",
      "comment": "To search into a matter; in the courts, of a prosecutor gathering evidence against someone (<span lang=\"la\">in aliquem</span>).",
      "evidence": [
        "Traupman 289"
